Distance: 1500m Conditions: Variable crossing tailwind, 14&#45;17mph with gusts. Lake was protected due to wind direction, and water was good at start, very choppy from 300&#45;600m. Wind shifted speed all afternoon. Comments: G3 started a boat length over the line. Great racing by all crews! We were lucky to have the sunshine.
